From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:46:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] editor symmetrize: wedge choice is orbit based (smallest
 angle from the master start, wraps at 2 pi), images outside the field are
 never read (no edge clamped smears on non square maps), seam cross-fades
 every wedge border towards the neighbouring image (continuous turns), start
 angle for rot2 / rot4, EdSymTest

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F37er45a7etRuMgEW1q3kY

